,p_message_text=>wwv_flow_string.join(wwv_flow_t_varchar2(
'Define the HTML markup used in the control break row element. Any tags opened here should be closed later in the <b>After Row</b> attribute below to form a container for the column break element defined in the <b>Column Break Format</b> attribute.',
