,p_name=>'PE.PROPERTY.DA_EXECUTION_TYPE.HELP'
,p_message_text=>wwv_flow_string.join(wwv_flow_t_varchar2(
'<p>Choose the type of execution method for the Dynamic Action. This defines if the actions are fired immediately, debounced, or throttled.</p>',
'        <p>If a Client-side Condition is defined, it will be evaluated when the Dynamic Action and its Actions are executed, not when the event fires.</p>'))
