'<p>Enter the text to be displayed in the event that the validation does not pass.</p>',
'<p>You can use <code>#LABEL#</code> as placeholder for the label of the associated page item or <code>#COLUMN_HEADER#</code> for the heading of the associated editable region column. The placeholders are not supported if error display location is set'
||' to On Error Page.</p>'))
