wwv_flow_imp_shared.create_message(
 p_id=>wwv_flow_imp.id(489470349344203315)
,p_name=>'PE.PROPERTY.LINK_EXAMPLE.COMPONENT_PROPERTY.CLASSIC_REPORT_PRINT_ATTR.HELP'
,p_message_text=>wwv_flow_string.join(wwv_flow_t_varchar2(
'<p>Report regions can be printed using the standard print link, shown below the report region, or using a button. If you want to use a button, remove the link label and create a button on your page, using the URL shown in Print URL as the button targ'
||'et.</p>',
'<p>Using buttons to print report regions enables you to set session state. This is useful if you are planning to support printing to several different output formats (Word, Excel, PDF, and so on) and want to display a button, link, or image for each '
||'option. For this implementation, use the output format derived from item option and include the item name and value in your Print URL.</p>'))
,p_version_scn=>37166067046547
);
