'<p>For example, if this item is named <code>P1_X</code>, you could use post calculation expressions such as <code>UPPER(:P1_X)</code>, <code>INITCAP(:P2_Y)</code>, <code>MIN(:P1_X, :P2_Y - 200)</code>, <code>NVL(:P1_X, :P2_Y)</code>, or a function ca'
