,p_name=>'PE.PROPERTY.PWA_PUSH_CREDENTIAL_ID.HELP'
,p_message_text=>wwv_flow_string.join(wwv_flow_t_varchar2(
'',
'<p>Credentials are required to setup push notification securely. A public and private key pair are used respectively to allow users to subscribe to push notifications on the client side, and for the server to send the notifications to the subscribers'
||'.</p>',
'<p>Select the credential to authenticate against. To edit the credential, navigate to <strong>Web Credentials</strong> in <strong>Workspace Utilities</strong></p>.'))
,p_version_scn=>37166067046438
);
