wwv_flow_imp_shared.create_message(
 p_id=>wwv_flow_imp.id(6576437507224674)
,p_name=>'PE.PROPERTY.TEXT_QUERY_FUNCTION_TYPE.HELP'
,p_message_text=>wwv_flow_string.join(wwv_flow_t_varchar2(
'',
'<p>The Oracle Text query syntax is very complex and powerful and provides a rich set of query operators to deal with wildcards, stemming, fuzzy searches and so forth. For end users, this syntax is often hard to understand. To simplify the search proc'
||'ess for users, you can select a function that automatically converts simple end user input into an Oracle Text query, with the advanced search features applied automatically. Select the Text Query Function type to use.'))
,p_version_scn=>20179872
);
wwv_flow_imp_shared.create_message(
 p_id=>wwv_flow_imp.id(6576974905224685)
,p_name=>'PE.PROPERTY.TEXT_QUERY_FUNCTION_TYPE.LOV.CUSTOM.D'
,p_message_text=>'Custom'
,p_version_scn=>22278504
);
wwv_flow_imp_shared.create_message(
 p_id=>wwv_flow_imp.id(6577071069224685)
,p_name=>'PE.PROPERTY.TEXT_QUERY_FUNCTION_TYPE.LOV.CUSTOM.HELP'
,p_message_text=>'Provide a custom function.'
,p_version_scn=>22278504
);
wwv_flow_imp_shared.create_message(
 p_id=>wwv_flow_imp.id(6576530455224684)
,p_name=>'PE.PROPERTY.TEXT_QUERY_FUNCTION_TYPE.LOV.EXPERT_SEARCH.D'
,p_message_text=>'Expert Search'
,p_version_scn=>22278504
);
wwv_flow_imp_shared.create_message(
 p_id=>wwv_flow_imp.id(6576625853224685)
,p_name=>'PE.PROPERTY.TEXT_QUERY_FUNCTION_TYPE.LOV.EXPERT_SEARCH.HELP'
,p_message_text=>'This function supports more advanced search operators for precise queries. It allows exact matching, Boolean operators (AND, OR, NOT), precedence with parentheses and proximity search. Additional parameters allow customizing search behavior. This is '
||'best when requiring highly accurate results from very specific queries. Also see the <code>QUERY_EXPERT_SEARCH</code> function within the <code>APEX_SEARCH</code> package.'
,p_version_scn=>20179872
);
wwv_flow_imp_shared.create_message(
 p_id=>wwv_flow_imp.id(6576749461224685)
,p_name=>'PE.PROPERTY.TEXT_QUERY_FUNCTION_TYPE.LOV.SEARCH_ENGINE.D'
,p_message_text=>'Search Engine'
,p_version_scn=>22278504
);
wwv_flow_imp_shared.create_message(
 p_id=>wwv_flow_imp.id(6576852972224685)
,p_name=>'PE.PROPERTY.TEXT_QUERY_FUNCTION_TYPE.LOV.SEARCH_ENGINE.HELP'
,p_message_text=>'This function performs a query relaxation search to retrieve relevant results beyond just exact matches. The goal is to get as many related results as possible, allowing users to easily find related information without needing to input precise querie'
||'s. The search process begins with an exact match search and then progressively relaxes the query using techniques like stemming and fuzzy matching. While maximizing the number of results, the search engine function ensures that the most exact and rel'
||'evant matches are always ranked at the top of the search results.'
,p_version_scn=>42020677
);
wwv_flow_imp_shared.create_message(
 p_id=>wwv_flow_imp.id(6576346537223643)
,p_name=>'PE.PROPERTY.TEXT_QUERY_FUNCTION_TYPE.PROMPT'
,p_message_text=>'Text Query Function'
,p_version_scn=>42020677
);
wwv_flow_imp_shared.create_message(
