,p_message_text=>'Enter the text message that displays in the <strong>Messages</strong> area, when the <strong>Maximum Rows to Process</strong> limit is exceeded for the layer. Use the <strong>#MAX_ROW_COUNT#</strong> substitution for the amount of rows actually fetch'
