,p_name=>'UTR.HELP.P2'
,p_message_text=>wwv_flow_string.join(wwv_flow_t_varchar2(
'After making changes, attributes can easily be restored, either for the complete theme style by pressing the Reset button, or pressing the reset icon for the group. ',
'',
'For attributes that allow the selection of foreground and background colors, the check-box preceding the two color selections indicates color contrast information based on Web Content Accessibility Guidelines (WCAG) 2.0. A higher calculated contrast '
