,p_name=>'WWV_FLOW_CUSTOM_AUTH_STD.ACTION14'
,p_message_text=>'Any username/password combination entered into the login form will be considered valid. The username entered will be used as the name of the logged-in user for the life of the session. This technique can be useful while you are developing your applic'
||'ation but before any actual user accounts are established.'
,p_version_scn=>37165770887607
