'Limit the departments using:',
'  <code>DEPTNO = 10</code>'))
,p_help_text=>'Enter the SQL WHERE clause to append to the generated SELECT statement. Use this attribute to limit the records used within automatically generated SQL calls.'
);
wwv_flow_imp_shared.create_plugin_attribute(
 p_id=>wwv_flow_imp.id(361802100261724338)
,p_plugin_id=>wwv_flow_imp.id(361799714569626543)
,p_attribute_scope=>'COMPONENT'
,p_attribute_sequence=>15
,p_display_sequence=>150
,p_prompt=>'Fetch Mode'
,p_attribute_type=>'SELECT LIST'
,p_is_required=>false
,p_is_common=>false
,p_is_translatable=>false
,p_lov_type=>'STATIC'
,p_deprecated_values=>'D'
,p_help_text=>wwv_flow_string.join(wwv_flow_t_varchar2(
'<p>',
'This option exists for backwards compatibility only.',
'New applications should always leave this setting empty.',
'The option "Set Memory Cache on Display" is deprecated and is not utilized in processes generated with this release of &PRODUCT_NAME..',
'</p>',
'<p>',
'When an Automated Row Fetch process selects a row, the corresponding page items are set to the fetched column values. The DML Fetch Mode setting determines when that happens. The default mode updates the in-memory session state immediately when the r'
||'ow is fetched. The mode ''Set Memory Cache on Display'' updates this session state only when (and if) the item is rendered. If you need to reference the fetched value of the item using bind variable or <code>v(''ITEM_NAME'')</code> syntax between the tim'
||'e of the row fetch and the time of the item rendering, you must use the default fetch mode. When you create a new Automatic Row Fetch process, its fetch mode is set to this default mode. Unless your page''s logic depends on the ''On Display'' behavior, '
||'we suggest that you update this process to use default behavior, to give you maximum flexibility to reference fetched column values during page rendering.',
'</p>'))
);
wwv_flow_imp_shared.create_plugin_attr_value(
 p_id=>wwv_flow_imp.id(361803025912727611)
,p_plugin_attribute_id=>wwv_flow_imp.id(361802100261724338)
,p_display_sequence=>20
,p_display_value=>'Set Memory Cache on Display [Deprecated]'
,p_return_value=>'D'
);
end;
/
