||'classes used for each node.</p>',
'<p>Typical values are:</p>',
'<ul>',
'<li><strong><code>a-Icon</code></strong> This allows using a small number of built-in APEX icons such as <code>icon-circle</code> or <code>icon-tree-folder</code>.</li>',
'<li><strong><code>fa</code></strong> This allows using Font APEX or Font Awesome icons. The Universal Theme makes one of these icon libraries available.</li>',
'</ul>',
'<p>If no value is given there is no icon type. The icon type CSS class, if needed, can be included in the icon column. For example the icon column value could be "fa fa-user".',
'For a tree with no icons set the Icon Type, and Default Icon attributes to empty and in the SQL Query source the icon column should be null.',
'Custom or third party themes may have their own font or CSS sprite icon library and use a different icon type/prefix class that you can specify here.</p>'))
);
