,p_help_text=>wwv_flow_string.join(wwv_flow_t_varchar2(
'<p>Define how the options will be rendered in the select box.</p>',
'<p>The attribute supports template directives.</p> ',
'<p>Columns need to be defined first as <strong>Additional Display Columns</strong> in the List of Values to reference them in the HTML expression by name.</p>',
'<p>Display and return values can be referenced in the HTML expression as &APEX$ITEM%d. and &APEX$ITEM%r. respectively.</p>'))
);
