,p_help_text=>wwv_flow_string.join(wwv_flow_t_varchar2(
'<p>Enter a JavaScript function that takes an options object for the Popup LOV item, modifies the object, and returns it. This allows advanced customization of the Popup LOV item dialog and its contents during initialization.</p>',
'',
'<p>These options are passed to the <code>popup</code> widget or jQuery UI <code>dialog</code> widget:<br>',
'draggable, resizable, width, height, minWidth, minHeight, maxWidth, and maxHeight<br>',
'See the JQuery UI dialog widget documentation for details.</p>',
'',
'<p>When the results are displayed in a simple list the <code>defaultIconListOptions</code> option is an object that is passed to the <code>tableModelView</code> widget. See the APEX tableModelView widget documentation for the available options.</p>',
'',
'<p>When the results are displayed in a grid the <code>defaultGridOptions</code> option is an object that is passed to the <code>grid</code> widget.',
'See the APEX grid widget documentation for the available options.</p>'))
);
